Local modification (svalbard, 2026-11-08) of gf180mcu_ocd_ip__biasgen @ 96a93f811a10c0b63111a5bd862e3173300802d4
(Apache-2.0, original (c) Open Circuit Design, LLC), applied after biasgen-dvdd-dvss-pin-alignment.patch.
Adds 4 separate 100 um x 38 um MIM capacitors (~30 pF total) from the bandgap-loop feedback node vfb
(bottom plates) to avss (top plates), placed above the cell.  The vbg-referenced loop
(bias_amp_large -> pbias -> pstack -> vfb/R2) had -31 deg phase margin at 3.3 V (-49 deg at 5 V).
vfb is reached on metal5 from the C2 bottom-plate via4 strip; avss by a metal5 hop from the avss
metal4 strap at the left end.  Schematic: C3 (m=4) in bias_generator_fe.

